th removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429683\">7055B90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428939\">1072C44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428938\">1072C16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429109\">2110A10</a>\n                                           .</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>After completing gearbox removal\nrefitting, when removing the crankcase sump, do not support the\npower unit as described in the gearbox removal/refitting procedure\nbut as follows:</p></aside><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429732\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Fit the tool (1a), complete with support mountings (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Crossmember</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.595.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Support mountings</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.650.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit the tools (2a) and (2b), then connect them to the engine\nusing link (2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Crossmember</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.851.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Vertical support</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.748.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043898.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428939\">1072C44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428938\">1072C16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil into a suitable\ncontainer.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not disperse the oil into the\nenvironment, as indiscriminate dispersal of this product causes pollution.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the manual gearbox and differential to\nthe cylinder block/crankcase.</p><p>3. Undo the nuts (3a) and the bolts (3b) securing the crankcase\nsump.</p><p>4. Use the tool to cut the crankcase sump sealant.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.718.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Remove the crankcase sump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044056.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429110\">2110A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the drain plug on the engine sump and drain the oil fully\ninto a suitable container.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not disperse the oil into the\nenvironment, as indiscriminate dispersal of this product causes pollution.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052471.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil into a suitable\ncontainer.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not disperse the oil into the\nenvironment, as indiscriminate dispersal of this product causes pollution.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>2. Undo the nuts (2a) and the bolts (2b) fixing the crankcase sump.</p><p>3. Use the tool to cut the crankcase sump sealant.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.718.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Remove the crankcase sump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043689.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>Remove the crankcase sump as described\nbelow.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the bracket between the manual\ngearbox/engine (1b) complete with bottom flywheel guard (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043899.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Thoroughly clean the contact surfaces of\ncrankcase sump and cylinder block of sealant residues.</p><p>Apply silicon sealant around the edge of\nthe crankcase sump.</p><p>1. Refit the crankcase sump</p><p>2. Tighten nuts (2a) and bolts (2b) securing the engine block to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>OIL SUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>OIL SUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the bolts fixing the manual gearbox and differential\nto the crankcase sump to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>MANUAL GEARBOX</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase sump side) 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Tighten the engine oil drain plug to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044057.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>1. Undo nuts (1a) and bolts (1b) securing the oil sump to the crankcase.</p><p>2. Use the tool to cut the crankcase sump sealant.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.718.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the crankcase sump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052472.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=